Third-party code in this repository
====================================

Every file that contains code adapted from another project carries a header:

    # Provenance: adapted from <repo>@<commit> <path> (<SPDX>, © <holder>)

and the project is listed below with its full licence text.

Allowed sources: permissive licences only (MIT, BSD, Apache-2.0). Confirm the licence
at the pinned commit before adapting. GPL/LGPL/AGPL sources (including python-kasa and
plugp100) are never allowed. See CLAUDE.md rule 2 and docs/ARCHITECTURE.md decision 3.

